# Per-run probe artifacts, full execution logs and the run receipt live under the resolved
# run work root (lme_resolved_run.work_root, under <checkout>/.work; asserted by the runner,
# no fallback). Only the mechanism is committed. The run receipt is written to
# <work_root>/receipts/LATEST.yml (codex-tick184);
# the tracked receipts/LATEST.yml is a historical record the runner no longer writes.
runs/
snap.tar
